 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Big Love from Ultra Deep Space"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "超深宇宙より愛をこめて"
   },
   {
    "ja-ro": "Chōshin Uchū Yori Ai wo Komete"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Teradate Ten doesn't like getting involved with people and thus hasn't been watching TV or looking at her smartphone. As a result, she is the last to learn that not only has a UFO landed on Earth, but the alien visitor, Lulucielamo Mocophishim Klasslamonira, has transferred to her school and chosen her as her bride!",
   "ja": "「無限に広がるこの宇宙で、私を見つけた君のことが知りたい。」\n\n中学時代のトラウマから人と距離を置き、一人で学校生活を送っていた寺館天。\nしかしある日、遠い異星のお姫様・ルルがやって来て、天の花嫁になると告げる。\n静かで孤独だった天の青春は大きく変わり始めて…。\n\n遥か銀河を超えた青春ガールズラブ開幕!!"
  },
